<title>UK: Mayflower becomes FTSE 250 stock.</title>
<headline>Mayflower becomes FTSE 250 stock.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mayflower Corp Plc will become a FTSE 250 stock from the close of trading today, replacing Northern Electric after CE Electric declared its offer for the British utility unconditional, the London stock exchange said.</p>
<p>Mayflower, an auto engineering company,  will also become a constituent of the FTSE 350 Lower Yield Index and will  be removed from the FTSE SmallCap Index.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
